   {"role": "heading", "text": "Summary"},
   {"role": "list", "text": "Every measurement has an uncertainty."},
   {"role": "list", "text": "Repeat measurements to reduce random error."},
   {"role": "list", "text": "Calibrate instruments to catch systematic error."},
   {"role": "list", "text": "Always report units and uncertainty."},
